  "solution": "Here, the following logic is followed\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b24713d6462890a49740581bbfced220b127660796307adca66a016b4ecd6548.png] \n\n1778 - (13 × 13) = 1778 - 169 = 1609\n\n1609 - (12 × 12) = 1609 - 144 = 1465\n\n1465 - (11 × 11) = 1465 - 121 = 1344\n\n1344 - (10 × 10) = 1344 - 100 = 1244\n\n1244 - (9 × 9) = 1244 - 81 = 1163\n\nTherefore,** '?'** will be replaced by **'1163'**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** option(4)**",
